now in background a node fails which was storing the updated timelines.
so here we are ok to show the outdated timelines and in the mean time we will fix it.
Some trade off with the consistency is a fine case here and we are not worried about it and it will not harm the user much.

so here we use AP.....



Hybrid:
We can go with HYBRID approach also where for some part we use CP and for some part we use AP.



